needs it, activate the environment first:

1. Look for conda at `/opt/miniconda3`, `/opt/conda`, or `./opt/miniconda3`, then
   run `. <conda-root>/etc/profile.d/conda.sh ; conda activate <env>`.
2. Otherwise check `/usr/local/bin/python`, or a `.venv`/`venv` inside
   {{ instance.repo_path }}.
3. Read the repository README for the documented commands.

